<p>The material tint system enables the textures of a model to be tinted various colours without editing the textures themselves directly. It consists of two parts: the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/TNT" title="TNT">TNT</a> file, which contains the colour information, and the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Texture%20Formats#Tint_Map" title="Texture Formats">tint map</a>, which defines the areas in which a tint will be applied. Tinting allows for the easy expansion of the number of items in the game without requiring the creation of new art assets (models and textures).
</p><p>Tints are created in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Material%20editor" title="Material editor">material editor</a>.
</p>
